# Prettier only reads a .gitignore next to its own working directory, so
# everything the repository root .gitignore excludes here is still examined
# unless it is repeated. Without this file `npx prettier --check .` aborts
# outright on `data/logs/nzbhydra2-log.json`, which is newline-delimited JSON
# rather than a single JSON expression -- a crash, not a formatting finding.

# Runtime and build output, all git-ignored.
data/
logs/
playwright-report/
target/
test-results/
visual-evidence/

# Generated by npm; never hand-formatted.
package-lock.json

# The Java module's sources and test resources. Not part of this TypeScript
# project, and `initialNzbhydra.yml` is byte-sensitive fixture input.
src/

# Tracked fixture data for the v1 config-migration test. Reformatting it would
# change what that test actually feeds the migrator.
instanceData/

# Deliberately NOT ignored: tests/*.ts, playwright.config.ts, and tsconfig.json.
# Those are real sources that have never been Prettier-formatted, tracked as a
# separate open candidate in docs/frontend-migration/MAINTENANCE.md. Silencing
# them here would hide that debt rather than discharge it.
